OL,3,CSupporting the mental health and
OL,4,Cwellbeing of parents
OL,6,FLike many new mothers, Michelle
OL,7,FBradley felt overwhelmed after the
OL,8,Fbirth of her child.
OL,10,FBut it quickly spiralled to a point
OL,11,Fwhere she suffered extreme anxiety,
OL,12,Fsleepless nights to the point where
OL,13,Fshe felt she may take her own life in
OL,14,Fsheer desperation.
OL,16,FAfter contacting her GP, she realised
OL,17,Fthe range of options for help for new
OL,18,Fparents were limited and services were
OL,19,Fextremely limited.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/6
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
