PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786272503
OL,3,CSupporting the mental health and
OL,4,Cwellbeing of parents
OL,6,FUsing whatever little help was out
OL,7,Fthere, Michelle got through this
OL,8,Ftraumatic time but she wanted to use
OL,9,Fher experience to help others and thus
OL,10,Fthe concept of The Parent Rooms was
OL,11,Fborn.
OL,13,FThe Parent Rooms is a small charity
OL,14,Fbased in North Belfast which helps
OL,15,Fparents from all over NI who are
OL,16,Fsuffering mental health issues or are
OL,17,Fstruggling with the realities of
OL,18,Fparenthood.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/6
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786272503
OL,3,CSupporting the mental health and
OL,4,Cwellbeing of parents
OL,6,FCounselling, therapy and group work
OL,7,Fare offered to parents who feel like
OL,8,Fthey need help.
OL,10,FThe charity's slogan is Engage,
OL,11,FEvolve, Empower and Michelle is
OL,12,Femphatic about the need for people to
OL,13,Freach out and just open up.
OL,15,FThere can be a stigma for parents
OL,16,Fadmitting that they are not in a good
OL,17,Fplace but as Michelle is keen to
OL,18,Femphasise that if a parent is
OL,19,Fsuffering from mental health issues,
OL,20,Fthat can affect the entire family unit.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/6
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786272503
OL,3,CSupporting the mental health and
OL,4,Cwellbeing of parents
OL,6,FSo firstly, Engage and then as that
OL,7,Fparent receives help, then they evolve
OL,8,Fand progress. And then finally, as
OL,9,Fthey come out of that dark place, they
OL,10,Fcan be Empowered to help others. It's
OL,11,Fa progressive concept.
OL,13,FLike anyone who runs a charity in NI
OL,14,Fright now, there are challenges,
OL,15,Fmainly around funding. Michelle admits
OL,16,Fit is hard.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/6
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
