PN,41705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786272503
OL,3,CSupporting the mental health and
OL,4,Cwellbeing of parents
OL,6,FEffectively she never knows if the
OL,7,Fcharity will exist in six months time.
OL,8,FThe charity has just been nominated
OL,9,Ffor a Centre of Social Justice award
OL,10,Fand as well as being a vindication of
OL,11,Fthe charity's work, she hopes it'll
OL,12,Fprovide more exposure and recognition
OL,13,Ffor The Parent Rooms.
OL,15,FAs Michelle says, it is small
OL,16,Fcharities who are often plugging the
OL,17,Fgaps in services. Services which are
OL,18,Fso vital to those who need them.
OL,20,FFor more information, visit: https:/
OL,21,F/www.theparentrooms.co.uk
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/6
